Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: qlksqomqvstuplppllrpqownwwvsylxz

Agents should send and read p7x.dev mail without holding the Fastmail
credentials. This jail is the one place that holds them. It shares
the host's addresses like the client jails, so its services can listen
on the loopback that every jail on beastie reaches, and nothing off
beastie does.

The credentials stay on the host and are mounted read-only into this
jail alone, readable only by the mailcred group. A second mount keeps
mail state outside the jail root, so a rebuild does not fetch the
mail again. The README documents how the operator stores the
credentials.
